OL,3,GNEWSAManx Radio breached licence
OL,4,Acondition over spoken content
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man's national radio
OL,7,Fstation breached its licence conditions
OL,8,Fby not broadcasting enough spoken
OL,9,Fcontent, the regulator has found.
OL,11,FUnder its licence conditions, Manx
OL,12,FRadio's output is required to hit a
OL,13,Ftarget of 40% but averaged 35.75% when
OL,14,Fmonitored.
OL,16,FThe regulator launched the inquiry in
OL,17,FMay after concerns were raised over the
OL,18,Fimpact of its music-heavy online sister
OL,19,Fstation ` Manx Radio Gold ` which is
OL,20,Fregularly carried on its AM frequency.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
